  "body": "Positioned on the ground floor of the highly sought-after La Residence De La Mer, this modern two-bedroom apartment presents an attractive opportunity to secure a coastal investment just moments from the golden sands of Orewa Beach.\r\nOffering 2 double bedrooms and a modern bathroom with convenient ensuite access from the master bedroom, the apartment combines practical living with a superb beachside location.\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area flows seamlessly to a sunny north-east-facing outdoor entertaining space, ideal for enjoying the relaxed Orewa lifestyle. Gated parking, low-maintenance grounds and the convenient ground-floor position further add to the appeal.\r\nThe vendor has advised that a proposed 12-month tenancy is currently being finalised. Interested purchasers are invited to contact Ed for the latest tenancy status and, once confirmed, full tenancy details will be made available.\r\nJust a short stroll from Orewa's cafés, restaurants, shops, everyday amenities and one of Auckland's most popular beaches, this is an opportunity to secure a well-positioned coastal property with genuine investment appeal.\r\nThe vendors remain committed to their next chapter and are motivated to achieve a sale.\r\nContact Ed Scanlan today for further information or to arrange a viewing.\r\nPlease note: images are digitally staged.",
